# ✨ Canikks' Magical NixOS Dotfiles ✨

Welcome to my little corner of digital magic! (◕‿◕✿) This repository holds the secret spells and charms that make my NixOS system run smoothly, beautifully, and perfectly! 🌸✨

---

## 🎀 About This Magic

This is a comprehensive, flake-based NixOS configuration! It's designed to be super reproducible (like a magic spell that works every time! 🪄), high-performance, and super easy to maintain. 

**The core ingredients used in this potion:**
* ❄️ **NixOS Unstable** (The foundation of my magic!)
* 🏠 **Home Manager** (To keep my user environment cozy and organized!)
* 🔐 **SOPS-Nix** (To keep my precious secrets safe and hidden!)
* 🍃 **Niri** (My lovely Wayland compositor!)
* 🎨 **Dank Material Shell** (For all the desktop prettiness!)

