## ✨ Magical Features

### 🏔️ The Great System Foundation
- **Modular Magic:** Everything is separated into host and home configs so it's super clean! 🧹
- **Secret Protection:** SOPS integration keeps my secrets under a powerful shield! 🛡️
- **Speedy Builds:** Optimized Nix builds to make everything go *zoom*! 🏎️💨

### 🖥️ The Desktop Wonderland
- **Smooth Windows:** Niri provides a beautiful, flowing window management experience! 🌊
- **Pretty Shells:** A perfectly themed desktop environment! 🎀
- **Terminal Paradise:** A collection of amazing terminal emulators for every mood! ⌨️✨

### 🛠️ The Developer's Workshop
- **Dev Environments:** `Devenv` makes setting up new projects as easy as waving a wand! 🪄
- **Pro Tools:** All my favorite CLI tools are ready and waiting to help! ⚒️

### 🌐 System Services & Safety
- **Pure DNS:** Blocky DNS keeps things fast and safe! 🛡️
- **Smooth Audio:** PipeWire makes sure everything sounds magical! 🎵
- **Strong Walls:** A restrictive firewall to keep the bad vibes out! 🏰

