## 🪄 How to Cast the Spells (Installation)

Follow these steps to bring this magic to your own system! (๑˃ᴗ˂)ﻭ

### 1. Summon the Repository 📥
```bash
git clone https://gitlab.com/Canikks/dotfiles.git ~/.dotfiles
cd ~/.dotfiles
```

### 2. Activate the System Magic ⚡
```bash
sudo nixos-rebuild switch --flake .#utkar
```

### 3. Cozy Up Your Home Environment 🏠
```bash
home-manager switch --flake .#utkar
```

---

## 📜 Common Rituals (Usage)

Keep these handy for your daily magic! ♪

| Ritual | Command |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Update Magic Ingredients** | `nix flake update` (or `nfu`!) |
| **Rebuild the World** | `sudo nixos-rebuild switch --flake .#utkar` (or `nrs`!) |
| **Enter Dev Mode** | `devenv shell` |
| **Make it Pretty (Format)** | `alejandra .` |
| **Check the Magic** | `nix flake check --impure` |

---

## 🛡️ Safety Charms & Maintenance

### 💖 Staying Safe
- **Keep Secrets Hidden:** Always use SOPS for sensitive info! 🔐
- **Watch the Walls:** My firewall is strict—make sure it's working! 🏰
- **Test Before You Fly:** Use `nixos-rebuild test` before making changes permanent! 🧪

### 🛠️ Maintenance Tips
1. **Keep it Simple!** Don't make the magic too complicated! 🌸
2. **Document Your Spells!** Add comments so you remember what they do! 📝
3. **Use Generations!** If a spell goes wrong, you can always go back in time! ⏳✨

